  _skillName: Bolt Lance
  _description: Attack Pattern Directive Group 3 - Split Attention (FacingArrowhead
    pattern). Warning glow, then a chevron highlights pointing toward the target's
    facing direction - the target's own cell and one step toward the tip are both
    safe, nested inside the chevron; the solid wall behind and the tapering body/tip
    around the safe pocket are all real. Standing still is actually safe here, even
    though the whole marked shape looks dangerous.
